== SOURCE
"c:" u_se< "Combinators"
== TITLE
Importing a library
== NOTE "c:"
The alias
The prefix this file will write the library's names with: `c:K_`, `c:B_`. Drawn raised, joined to the macro.
== NOTE u_se<
The use macro
A name ending in `<` runs before the program is checked: it brings the library in. Drawn bold yellow, as every macro.
== NOTE "Combinators"
The library
A name (a built-in standard library, or `Name.xtl` beside the file or on `XETAL_PATH`) or a path. Library names are capitalized.
